  "abstract_summary": "0.6.3: sixteen memory and checkpoint stores measured, eight that claim tamper evidence and eight that do not, against nine storage-level edits, with control C3 (the landed guard) proving every edit changed exactly what the case intends before a verdict is recorded. Implements the test method filed as IETF draft-khan...",
